  "stem": "“I am knowing the answer” is not used in this lesson. Why?",
  "options": [
    "Because know must take -s after I.",
    "Because know tells what a person understands; it is not an action happening now.",
    "Because answer must come before know.",
    "Because now always changes know to knew."
